# `bun run dev` reads the repo-root .env (see ../../.env.example), shared with the API.
# Deployed workers get PUBLIC_API_URL and PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY (the public Turnstile site key;
# its secret is SECRET_TURNSTILE_SECRET on the API worker only) from the "vars" in wrangler.jsonc, not from
# a .env file.
